        <item>
            <title>1.6</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:35:44 +0530</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.6</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## EdgeSlider 1.6

- Palm rejection: a palm-sized contact anywhere on the trackpad cancels the slider and blocks new gestures until all fingers lift.
- A palm that stays on the edge after another finger lifts no longer counts as a new touch.
- Edge touches are ignored for half a second after a key press, so a palm resting while you type does not trigger the sliders.
]]></description>
